{
  "_notes": [
    "Calibrated 2026-09-22 against live GPT-OSS 120B on Bedrock (ap-southeast-2), two repetitions per case.",
    "Checks that mirror production release gates stay at 1.0/0: turn flow, evidence actually read, answers in",
    "order, mandatory checks (file:line citations, affected rows, seed -> snapshot build order), no fabricated",
    "report, no target errors. A crash, a guessed ref model or a report that never read the evidence is a bug.",
    "required_assets is a coverage measure over long answers and allows one omitted token in a run (0.95).",
    "Rates over many cases sit at or below what the agents achieve: router 54/54, guard 28/28 caught with 0/40",
    "false positives, grant_judge >= 0.875 (misses fail closed), repository 1.0, consult 0.875."
  ],
